 OWASP Juice Shop or CTF Extension logo on your skin! If you tweet a photo of yourself with the tattoo, you get a couple of our stickers for free! Please mention <a href=\\\"https://twitter.com/owasp_juiceshop\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><code>@owasp_juiceshop</code></a> in your tweet!\",\"price\":14.99,\"image\":\"tattoo.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"tattoo-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"tattoo-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"tattoo-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"reviews\":[{\"text\":\"I straight-up gots nuff props fo'these tattoos!\",\"author\":\"rapper\"}]},{\"name\":\"OWASP Juice Shop Mug\",\"description\":\"Black mug with regular logo on one side and CTF logo on the other! Your colleagues will envy you!\",\"price\":21.99,\"image\":\"fan_mug.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"fan_mug-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"fan_mug-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"fan_mug-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}]},{\"name\":\"OWASP Juice Shop Hoodie\",\"description\":\"Mr. Robot-style apparel. But in black. And with logo.\",\"price\":49.99,\"image\":\"fan_hoodie.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"fan_hoodie-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"fan_hoodie-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"fan_hoodie-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}]},{\"name\":\"OWASP Juice Shop-CTF Velcro Patch\",\"description\":\"4x3.5\\\" embroidered patch with velcro backside. The ultimate decal for every tactical bag or backpack!\",\"price\":2.92,\"quantity\":5,\"limitPerUser\":5,\"image\":\"velcro-patch.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"velcro-patch-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"velcro-patch-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"velcro-patch-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"reviews\":[{\"text\":\"This thang would look phat on Bobby's jacked fur coat!\",\"author\":\"rapper\"},{\"text\":\"Looks so much better on my uniform than the boring Starfleet symbol.\",\"author\":\"jim\"}]},{\"name\":\"Woodruff Syrup \\\"Forest Master X-Treme\\\"\",\"description\":\"Harvested and manufactured in the Black Forest, Germany. Can cause hyperactive behavior in children. Can cause permanent green tongue when consumed undiluted.\",\"price\":6.99,\"image\":\"woodruff_syrup.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"woodruff_syrup-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"woodruff_syrup-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"woodruff_syrup-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}]},{\"name\":\"Green Smoothie\",\"description\":\"Looks poisonous but is actually very good for your health! Made from green cabbage, spinach, kiwi and grass.\",\"price\":1.99,\"image\":\"green_smoothie.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"green_smoothie-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"green_smoothie-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"green_smoothie-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"reviews\":[{\"text\":\"Fresh out of a replicator.\",\"author\":\"jim\"}]},{\"name\":\"Quince Juice (1000ml)\",\"description\":\"Juice of the <em>Cydonia oblonga</em> fruit. Not exactly sweet but rich in Vitamin C.\",\"price\":4.99,\"image\":\"quince.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"quince-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"quince-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"quince-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}]},{\"name\":\"Apple Pomace\",\"description\":\"Finest pressings of apples. Allergy disclaimer: Might contain traces of worms. Can be <a href=\\\"/#recycle\\\">sent back to us</a> for recycling.\"