      "compression": 26963,
      "text": "{\"status\":\"success\",\"data\":[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Apple Juice (1000ml)\",\"description\":\"The all-time classic.\",\"price\":1.99,\"deluxePrice\":0.99,\"image\":\"apple_juice.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"apple_juice-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"apple_juice-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"apple_juice-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.362 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.362 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":24,\"name\":\"Apple Pomace\",\"description\":\"Finest pressings of apples. Allergy disclaimer: Might contain traces of worms. Can be <a href=\\\"/#recycle\\\">sent back to us</a> for recycling.\",\"price\":0.89,\"deluxePrice\":0.89,\"image\":\"apple_pressings.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"apple_pressings-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"apple_pressings-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"apple_pressings-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.367 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.367 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":6,\"name\":\"Banana Juice (1000ml)\",\"description\":\"Monkeys love it the most.\",\"price\":1.99,\"deluxePrice\":1.99,\"image\":\"banana_juice.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"banana_juice-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"banana_juice-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"banana_juice-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.363 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.363 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":52,\"name\":\"Basil Smoothie\",\"description\":\"A unique blend of fresh basil and ginger for a healthy kick.\",\"price\":2.99,\"deluxePrice\":2.99,\"image\":\"basil_smoothie.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"basil_smoothie-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"basil_smoothie-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"basil_smoothie-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.369 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.369 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":51,\"name\":\"Berry Juice (1000ml)\",\"description\":\"A delicious blend of fresh forest berries.\",\"price\":3.49,\"deluxePrice\":3.49,\"image\":\"berry_juice.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"berry_juice-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"berry_juice-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"berry_juice-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.369 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.369 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":42,\"name\":\"Best Juice Shop Salesman Artwork\",\"description\":\"Unique digital painting depicting Stan, our most qualified and almost profitable salesman. He made a succesful carreer in selling used ships, coffins, krypts, crosses, real estate, life insurance, restaurant supplies, voodoo enhanced asbestos and courtroom souvenirs before <em>finally</em> adding his expertise to the Juice Shop marketing team.\",\"price\":5000,\"deluxePrice\":5000,\"image\":\"artwork2.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"artwork2-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"artwork2-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"artwork2-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.368 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.368 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":53,\"name\":\"Bragă (500ml)\",\"description\":\"Traditional Balkan drink made from fermented millet. Lightly sweet-sour, refreshing, and naturally energizing.\",\"price\":2.49,\"deluxePrice\":2.49,\"image\":\"braga.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"braga-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"braga-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"braga-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.369 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.369 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":30,\"name\":\"Carrot Juice (1000ml)\",\"description\":\"As the old German saying goes: \\\"Carrots are good for the eyes. Or has anyone ever seen a rabbit with glasses?\\\"\",\"price\":2.99,\"deluxePrice\":2.99,\"image\":\"carrot_juice.jpeg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"carrot_juice-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"carrot_juice-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"carrot_juice-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.367 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.367 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":50,\"name\":\"Dragonfruit Juice (500ml)\",\"description\":\"Exotic and vibrant juice made from dragonfruit.\",\"price\":3.99,\"deluxePrice\":3.99,\"image\":\"dragonfruit_juice.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"dragonfruit_juice-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"dragonfruit_juice-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"dragonfruit_juice-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.369 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.369 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Eggfruit Juice (500ml)\",\"description\":\"Now with even more exotic flavour.\",\"price\":8.99,\"deluxePrice\":8.99,\"image\":\"eggfruit_juice.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"eggfruit_juice-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"eggfruit_juice-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"eggfruit_juice-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.363 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.363 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":54,\"name\":\"Elderflower Cordial (500ml)\",\"description\":\"Floral and fragrant soft drink made from elderflowers. Traditionally enjoyed chilled.\",\"price\":3.29,\"deluxePrice\":3.29,\"image\":\"elderflower_cordial.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"elderflower_cordial-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"elderflower_cordial-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"elderflower_cordial-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.369 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.369 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":25,\"name\":\"Fruit Press\",\"description\":\"Fruits go in. Juice comes out. Pomace you can send back to us for recycling purposes.\",\"price\":89.99,\"deluxePrice\":89.99,\"image\":\"fruit_press.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"fruit_press-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"fruit_press-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"fruit_press-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.367 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.367 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":49,\"name\":\"Grape Juice (1000ml)\",\"description\":\"Deep purple and full of antioxidants from selected grapes.\",\"price\":2.99,\"deluxePrice\":2.99,\"image\":\"grape_juice.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"grape_juice-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"grape_juice-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"grape_juice-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.369 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.369 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":22,\"name\":\"Green Smoothie\",\"description\":\"Looks poisonous but is actually very good for your health! Made from green cabbage, spinach, kiwi and grass.\",\"price\":1.99,\"deluxePrice\":1.99,\"image\":\"green_smoothie.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"green_smoothie-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"green_smoothie-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"green_smoothie-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.366 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.366 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":41,\"name\":\"Juice Shop \\\"Permafrost\\\" 2020 Edition\",\"description\":\"Exact version of <a href=\\\"https://github.com/juice-shop/juice-shop/releases/tag/v9.3.1-PERMAFROST\\\">OWASP Juice Shop that was archived on 02/02/2020</a> by the GitHub Archive Program and ultimately went into the <a href=\\\"https://github.blog/2020-07-16-github-archive-program-the-journey-of-the-worlds-open-source-code-to-the-arctic\\\">Arctic Code Vault</a> on July 8. 2020 where it will be safely stored for at least 1000 years.\",\"price\":9999.99,\"deluxePrice\":9999.99,\"image\":\"permafrost.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"permafrost-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"permafrost-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"permafrost-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.368 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.368 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"Lemon Juice (500ml)\",\"description\":\"Sour but full of vitamins.\",\"price\":2.99,\"deluxePrice\":1.99,\"image\":\"lemon_juice.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"lemon_juice-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"lemon_juice-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"lemon_juice-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.363 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.363 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":33,\"name\":\"Melon Bike (Comeback-Product 2018 Edition)\",\"description\":\"The wheels of this bicycle are made from real water melons. You might not want to ride it up/down the curb too hard.\",\"price\":2999,\"deluxePrice\":2999,\"image\":\"melon_bike.jpeg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"melon_bike-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"melon_bike-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"melon_bike-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.367 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.367 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":48,\"name\":\"Melon Juice (1000ml)\",\"description\":\"Refreshing and sweet juice made from ripe melons.\",\"price\":2.49,\"deluxePrice\":2.49,\"image\":\"melon_juice.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"melon_juice-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"melon_juice-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"melon_juice-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.369 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.369 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":38,\"name\":\"OWASP Juice Shop \\\"King of the Hill\\\" Facemask\",\"description\":\"Facemask with compartment for filter from 50% cotton and 50% polyester.\",\"price\":13.49,\"deluxePrice\":13.49,\"image\":\"fan_facemask.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"fan_facemask-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"fan_facemask-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"fan_facemask-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.368 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.368 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":8,\"name\":\"OWASP Juice Shop CTF Girlie-Shirt\",\"description\":\"For serious Capture-the-Flag heroines only!\",\"price\":22.49,\"deluxePrice\":22.49,\"image\":\"fan_girlie.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"fan_girlie-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"fan_girlie-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"fan_girlie-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.363 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.363 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":43,\"name\":\"OWASP Juice Shop Card (non-foil)\",\"description\":\"Mythic rare <em>(obviously...)</em> card \\\"OWASP Juice Shop\\\" with three distinctly useful abilities. Alpha printing, mint condition. A true collectors piece to own!\",\"price\":1000,\"deluxePrice\":1000,\"image\":\"card_alpha.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"card_alpha-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"card_alpha-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"card_alpha-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.368 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.368 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":34,\"name\":\"OWASP Juice Shop Coaster (10pcs)\",\"description\":\"Our 95mm circle coasters are printed in full color and made from thick, premium coaster board.\",\"price\":19.99,\"deluxePrice\":19.99,\"image\":\"coaster.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"coaster-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"coaster-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"coaster-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.367 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.367 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":37,\"name\":\"OWASP Juice Shop Holographic Sticker\",\"description\":\"Die-cut holographic sticker. Stand out from those 08/15-sticker-covered laptops with this shiny beacon of 80's coolness!\",\"price\":2,\"deluxePrice\":2,\"image\":\"holo_sticker.png\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"holo_sticker-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"holo_sticker-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"holo_sticker-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.368 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.368 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":19,\"name\":\"OWASP Juice Shop Hoodie\",\"description\":\"Mr. Robot-style apparel. But in black. And with logo.\",\"price\":49.99,\"deluxePrice\":49.99,\"image\":\"fan_hoodie.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"fan_hoodie-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"fan_hoodie-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"fan_hoodie-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.366 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.366 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":13,\"name\":\"OWASP Juice Shop Iron-Ons (16pcs)\",\"description\":\"Upgrade your clothes with washer safe <a href=\\\"https://www.stickeryou.com/products/owasp-juice-shop/794\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">iron-ons</a> of the OWASP Juice Shop or CTF Extension logo!\",\"price\":14.99,\"deluxePrice\":14.99,\"image\":\"iron-on.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"iron-on-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"iron-on-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"iron-on-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.365 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.365 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":45,\"name\":\"OWASP Juice Shop LEGO™ Tower\",\"description\":\"Want to host a Juice Shop CTF in style? Build <a href=\\\"https://github.com/OWASP/owasp-swag/blob/master/projects/juice-shop/lego/OWASP%20JuiceShop%20Pi-server%201.2.pdf\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">your own LEGO™ tower</a> which holds four Raspberry Pi 4 models with PoE HAT modules <a href=\\\"https://github.com/juice-shop/multi-juicer/blob/main/guides/raspberry-pi/raspberry-pi.md\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">running a MultiJuicer Kubernetes cluster</a>! Wire to a switch and connect to your network to have an out-of-the-box ready CTF up in no time!\",\"price\":799,\"deluxePrice\":799,\"image\":\"lego_case.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"lego_case-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"lego_case-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"lego_case-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.368 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.368 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":26,\"name\":\"OWASP Juice Shop Logo (3D-printed)\",\"description\":\"This rare item was designed and handcrafted in Sweden. This is why it is so incredibly expensive despite its complete lack of purpose.\",\"price\":99.99,\"deluxePrice\":99.99,\"image\":\"3d_keychain.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"3d_keychain-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"3d_keychain-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"3d_keychain-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.367 +00:00\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-11-06 19:39:34.367 +00:00\",\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":14,\"name\":\"OWASP Juice Shop Magnets (16pcs)\",\"description\":\"Your fridge will be even cooler with these OWASP Juice Shop or CTF Extension logo <a href=\\\"https://www.stickeryou.com/products/owasp-juice-shop/794\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">magnets</a>!\",\"price\":15.99,\"deluxePrice\":15.99,\"image\":\"magnets.jpg\",\"alternateImages\":[{\"file\":\"magnets-1x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"1x\"},{\"file\":\"magnets-2x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"2x\"},{\"file\":\"magnets-3x.avif\",\"format\":\"image/avif\",\"density\":\"3x\"}],\"createdAt\":\"2